// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// A15. A NULL measure makes a scalar expression NULL.
// Question: What is the total of salaries and commissions of each department?
// The sum of the commissions of departments 10 and 20 is NULL, so the total is
// NULL there; no COALESCE makes it zero.
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// KQL: scalar operation on two measure values, no COALESCE.
FIND emp e
FETCH e.deptno ASC, agg(e.sum_sal) + agg(e.sum_comm) totalpay
